Source: https://github.com/rust-iso/rust_iso4217
Revision: ce6b74546b3645ce11866acc93117128d2f7b1e0
Original material: src/lib.rs (SHA256 7401727ea4da05fcbf0d1d679705c0245989e83dbc697e831066f992875e183d).

Radroots changes: extract only current currency/fund alphabetic code and
minor-unit exponent facts in range 0-4; sort them; omit historic entries,
no-minor-unit entries, names, countries, numeric identifiers and all upstream
Rust/generator implementation. The Rust API is independently implemented.
This derived data retains the upstream Apache-2.0 license and attribution.

The publisher identifies SIX ISO 4217 lists as its currency source and Datahub
as its country-relationship source. No country relationships are included here.
All 165 selected pairs match the separately acquired official SIX List One
snapshot published 2026-09-17. The XML and ISO standard text are not distributed.
No cash/display rounding, exchange rate, payment rule or currency conversion
is implied. The registry is fixed; replacement requires explicit versioned
contract and provenance review. Derived artifacts must include this material
and its license/notice before adopting it.
